{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9a229ce7-89e9-8408-a1bb-2ee4086b7749",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T10:04:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lidia Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T09:59:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning! Great, thank you for picking up. My name is Lidia Andrade, and I'm calling for my mother. She lives at 467 Old Beach Road, over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:00:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 467 Old Beach Road. And what's going on there, Ms. Andrade?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's about the plowing. After last weekend's storm, the snow-to-rain one, Sunday into Monday, the street is still a mess. It's a dead end, and a dead-end street is always plowed last. Always. So it's Wednesday and there's still this heavy, packed slush that froze overnight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:00:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the road hasn't been fully plowed, or it was plowed but it's icy now? Let me make sure I have it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:00:50-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was plowed, wonderful, one pass, sometime Monday I think. But it's one lane wide and it's ice now, with ruts. My mother has to get out to her appointments and she won't risk it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:01:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. One pass on Monday, now it's frozen ruts, narrow, and she's at 467 Old Beach Road. Is that the end of the street, or partway down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Near the end, yes, the last few houses before it stops. The turnaround is the worst part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:01:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the turnaround area at the dead end. I'll note that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:01:42-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great! And can I ask for sand? Even just sand on the hill and the turnaround. We don't need anything fancy, just something so she can walk to the car without falling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in a request for sanding at that location. Sand and salt trucks go out by priority, main roads first, so side streets and dead ends can take a bit. But I'll get the request in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's totally understandable. Wonderful. Do you need a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:02:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Which number is best?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:02:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0166. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:02:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back: 401-555-0166. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:02:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I have a request for sand at 467 Old Beach Road, the turnaround at the dead end, and a note that the street is icy and narrow after the plowing on Monday. Anything else I should add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:03:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, just that the ruts are the real problem. If a plow could widen it even a little, that would be great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add that a second pass to widen it is requested. I can't tell you exactly when a crew will get there, but it goes to the supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:03:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, that's all I can ask. Honestly, this call is the highlight of my afternoon, you've been so helpful!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:03:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's still morning, but I'll take it. [pause] Is there anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha! Oh, you're right, it's morning, almost ten. No, that's everything. Thank you so much, Lorraine!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, and tell your mom to stay off that ice until it's sanded."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T10:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will! Great, bye now!"
    }
  ],
